    workspace: keep repository PR workflows local
    
    Use published development branches for ordinary workspace projects. Require
    pull requests only when the user requests them or the affected repository
    requires them, without extending vpsadmin-webui's workflow to other projects.
    
    Keep repository-specific branch, commit and tooling rules within their
    own repository. Preserve explicit integration approval and fast-forward-only
    local integration with direct SSH pushes, including PR-required projects.
